# Jupyter notebooks are large JSON; Prettier (or format-on-save) can rewrite the
# whole file and create noisy diffs. Edit cells in the notebook UI instead.
*.ipynb

# Generated by scripts/gen_ts_contracts.py — the generator owns these files'
# bytes and apps/api/server/tests/test_ts_contracts.py gates freshness by exact
# bytes and tests/contract/test_ts_contracts.py gates freshness by exact
# match. Letting Prettier requote them (JSON double quotes -> single) would drift
# the artifacts from their source of truth on every commit. One rule per output
# in gen_ts_contracts.OUTPUTS.
apps/web/lib/protocol/contracts.gen.ts
packages/sdk-ts/typescript-sdk/src/contracts.gen.ts
apps/mobile/src/services/contracts.gen.ts

# The agent ledger is a sealed append-only record: `grib ledger entry` stamps
# each entry with a ⟨seal:…⟩ hash over its exact bytes, and `grib ledger check`
# verifies them. Prettier's markdown printer escapes underscores (`\_x`) and
# rewrites emphasis (`**bold**` -> `_*bold*_`), which mutates sealed entry text
# and invalidates its seal — 11 seals broke on 2026-11-27 from exactly this.
# Never format this file.
docs/AGENT_SYNC.md
